<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
	<style type="text/css">.portalButton {
        display: inline-block;
        vertical-align: middle;
        padding: 14px 30px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: #0082cb;
        font: normal normal bold 16px Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 20px;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
	</style>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for submitting conditions to us. The following item needs your attention please:
<ul>
	<li>{{{Condition__c.Name}}} -&nbsp;{{{Condition__c.Description__c}}}</li>
</ul>
Reason for requesting again:

<ul>
	<li>{{{Condition__c.RejectionNotes__c}}}</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin-bottom:0;">Can you kindly assist to resolve this item immediately? I am here to assist you in every possible way. Please do not hesitate to contact me for any question or clarifications.</p>

<p style="margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Secure Conditions Portal:</strong></p>

<p><a class="portalButton" href="" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open Secure Portal</a></p>
<br />
<br />
</body>
</html>
